---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import MeetJosh from "@/components/MeetJosh.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="hey josh"
  description="fractional engineering leader focusing on accelerating delivery, not cost">
  <div class="flex flex-col px-4 lg:p-8 space-y-4">
    <div class="py-24 sm:pt-32">
      <MeetJosh />
    </div>
    <div class="py-24 sm:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:text-center">
          <h2
            class="mt-2 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-balance dark:text-white">
            Your part-time partner for everything tech
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg/8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
            From pre-launch prototyping to enterprise scaling,
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-2xl sm:mt-20 lg:mt-24 lg:max-w-none">
          <dl
            class="grid max-w-xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <dt
                class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base/7 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="-mt-2 size-6 text-2xl flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                  <span role="img" aria-label="magnifier">🔎</span>
                </span>
                Tech Strategy
              </dt>
              <dd
                class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                <p class="flex-auto">
                  You focus on running your business. I’ll focus on the tech
                  stuff. Stack analysis, architecture planning, and long-term
                  strategy — all delivered on your terms.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-6">
                  <a
                    href="/services/tech-strategy"
                    class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-500 dark:text-orange-400 dark:hover:text-orange-300"
                    >Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
                  >
                </p>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <dt
                class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base/7 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="-mt-2 size-6 text-2xl flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                  <span role="img" aria-label="team">👥</span>
                </span>
                Eng Team Leadership
              </dt>
              <dd
                class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                <p class="flex-auto">
                  Every tech team needs engineering direction. Some tech teams
                  need to budget for a full-time engineering director. The other
                  teams should reach out to me.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-6">
                  <a
                    href="/services/eng-leadership"
                    class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-500 dark:text-orange-400 dark:hover:text-orange-300"
                    >Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
                  >
                </p>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <dt
                class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-base/7 font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="-mt-2 size-6 text-2xl flex-none text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
                  <span role="img" aria-label="hammer-and-wrench">🛠️</span>
                </span>
                MVP Development
              </dt>
              <dd
                class="mt-4 flex flex-auto flex-col text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                <p class="flex-auto">
                  You bring the idea. I bring the tech chops. Nobody brings the
                  headache and cost from outsourcing agencies.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-6">
                  <a
                    href="/services/mvp-development"
                    class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-500 dark:text-orange-400 dark:hover:text-orange-300"
                    >Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
                  >
                </p>
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
